            "state": "translated",
            "value": "허먼 밀러, 카시나"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hey, I'm %@. First thing: what size are you? I only hunt %@ that are in stock in your size.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Hey, I'm %1$@. First thing: what size are you? I only hunt %2$@ that are in stock in your size."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hola, soy %1$@. Primero: ¿cuál es tu talla? Solo busco %2$@ que haya en tu talla."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Salut, moi c'est %1$@. D'abord : quelle taille fais-tu ? Je ne chasse que les %2$@ en stock dans ta taille."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "안녕하세요, 저는 %1$@예요. 먼저, 사이즈가 어떻게 되세요? 사이즈 재고가 있는 %2$@만 찾아드릴게요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hey, I'm %@. Tell me what you've been into lately, what you can't stand, or what you're hunting for, and I'll remember it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hola, soy %@. Cuéntame qué te gusta últimamente, qué no soportas o qué estás buscando, y lo recordaré."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Salut, moi c'est %@. Dis-moi ce qui te plaît en ce moment, ce que tu ne supportes pas ou ce que tu cherches, et je m'en souviendrai."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "안녕하세요, 저는 %@예요. 요즘 빠진 것, 질색인 것, 찾고 있는 것을 알려주세요. 기억해 둘게요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
