    "I couldn't make much out of that one. Tell me what you love about it and I'll remember.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No pude sacar mucho de esa. Dime qué te encanta de ella y lo recordaré."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je n'ai pas bien compris celui-là. Dis-moi ce que tu aimes dedans et je m'en souviendrai."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이건 잘 모르겠어요. 어떤 점이 좋은지 알려주시면 기억해 둘게요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I lost the connection there. Send that again?": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se me cortó la conexión. ¿Me lo reenvías?"
